getmouselocation 	the mouse location
getwindowclassname 	the class name of a window
getwindowfocus 	the focused window
getwindowgeometry 	the geometry of a window
getwindowname 	the name of a window
getwindowpid 	the pid of a window
--- xdotool search --
--all 	all conditions must match
--any 	any condition may match
--class 	match the window class
--classname 	match the window class name
--desktop=	only a desktop
--help 	show the help
--limit=	stop after N results
--maxdepth=	the depth of the search (-1: infinite)
--name 	match the window name
--onlyvisible 	only visible windows
--pid=	only the windows of a process
--prefix=	the prefix of the array's name
--role 	match the window role
--screen=	only a screen
--shell 	print the results as a shell array WINDOWS=( ... )
--sync 	wait until a window is found
--title 	the same as --name (deprecated)
